version 0.5.59
previous 0.5.58
- Sign-in is faster: your photos, apps and app data now come back side by side instead of one after another.
- More settings travel with you: screen timeout, colour and contrast, captions, Night Light schedule, keyboard and speech.
- On a slow connection, a large app's download picks up where it stopped instead of starting over.
- The download notice counts each app once, keeps its count through Pause and Resume, and names the same app as the card.
- A new Offline media switch can hold photo and video downloads until you are on Wi-Fi.
- What's using your space can free a folder's downloaded copies on this phone, and Report an issue shows its progress.
